OL,3,ARussell Brand sentenced to 10 years and
OL,4,Asix months for rape and sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand has been sentenced to
OL,7,F10-and-a-half years for rape and three
OL,8,Fcounts of sexual assault - he is likely
OL,9,Fto serve two-thirds of the sentence in
OL,10,Fprison
OL,12,FThe judge tells Brand he is a "sexual
OL,13,Fpredator", who told a "series of lies"
OL,14,Fand displayed "staggering arrogance"
OL,16,FEarlier, one victim told the court she
OL,17,Fwas "in shock and turmoil... I didn't
OL,18,Fhave any respect for myself"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
