OL,3,ARussell Brand sentenced to 10 years and
OL,4,Asix months for rape and sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother victim said "Russell Brand is a
OL,7,Fsexual predator who has no remorse",
OL,8,Fwhile another said she "felt powerless
OL,9,Fin that moment"
OL,11,FThe woman who Brand raped in 2009 told
OL,12,Fthe court she was "living with trauma",
OL,13,Fand feared she had contracted HIV
OL,15,FBrand faced seven charges: three of
OL,16,Frape, three of sexual assault and one
OL,17,Fof attempted indecent assault. He was
OL,18,Ffound not guilty on three counts
OL,20,FHis crimes took place between 2004 and
OL,21,F2009, and related to four women. They
OL,22,Fare all entitled to lifelong anonymity
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
