OL,3,AKrakow shooting suspect has died in
OL,4,Ahospital, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gunman suspected of killing six
OL,7,Fpeople in central Krakow, and his
OL,8,Fparents and sister at their home, died
OL,9,Fin hospital early on Monday, Polish
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FThe 24-year-old, who has been named as
OL,13,FMichal Oksinski by local media, was
OL,14,Finjured after opening fire in central
OL,15,FKrakow, the second largest city in
OL,16,FPoland, on Saturday, police said.
OL,18,FArmed officers raced to the scene and
OL,19,Fengaged in a gunfight with the suspect,
OL,20,Fwho was shot within three minutes of
OL,21,Fthe attack beginning, preventing a
OL,22,Ffurther massacre, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
