OL,3,ATrump says he was 'kidding' about Dana
OL,4,AWhite press secretary offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite said later that day he was going
OL,7,Fto meet the president on Monday, but
OL,8,Fwould not be drawn into whether or not
OL,9,Fhe would take the vacant position.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
